Reference validation uses NeMo 3.0.0. Relevant modules are conformer_encoder,
subsampling, conformer_modules, multi_head_attention, transducer_decoding/
tdt_label_looping, ctc_batched_beam_decoding, and ngram_lm/ngram_lm_batched.

Silero VAD is provided by the separately installed silero-vad package (MIT).
Its weights are copied into the user's model cache during preparation.
https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad

The surogate/surogate-ro-110m-streaming checkpoint is CC-BY-4.0:
https://huggingface.co/surogate/surogate-ro-110m-streaming
No acoustic, language-model, tokenizer, or VAD weights are bundled here.
